.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm provider-digest
.Nd The digest library \(la-\(ra provider functions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/core_dispatch.h
.In openssl/core_names.h
.Ft /*
  * Digests support the following function signatures in OSSL_DISPATCH arrays.
  *
.Fo 
.Fa "The function signatures are not actual functions"
.Fc
.
.Ft */

 /* Context management */
